SUMMARY:⛰️ 🛫 HIKING IN THE ALPS OF TRENTINO\, ITALY ⭐️July 2026
  (7 Days)
DESCRIPTION:Hiking Network\n⭐️ **A GUIDED HIKING TOUR OF THE ITALIAN A
 LPS** ⭐️\n(Includes most meals\, 5 guided hikes and private round-trip
  trail shuttle service)\n\n**July 25-31\, 2026** • 7 Days / 6 Nights\n\n
 **Difficulty level:** Beginner/ Intermediate (some hiking experience requi
 red)\n\n• **Price:** From EUR 1\,690.00 pp (about CAD $2\,700) in double
  occupancy.\nFlight NOT incl.\n\n**Max 17 participants**\n\n• HIGHLIGHTS
 \nExplore the towering mountain peaks\, bright-green valleys and quaint vi
 llages of the **Dolomites** (UNESCO Heritage Site) in the **Trentino** reg
 ion of Italy.\nFrom **Val di Sole\,** a central site that will allow you t
 o easily reach the starting points of each day hike\, you will experience 
 excursions of great satisfaction and with significantly different environm
 ental characteristics. You will explore the jagged peaks of the **Brent**a
  Dolomites and the tonalite-rock mountains of **Adamello**\, and move on t
 o the sunny southern side of the **Ortles-Cevedale** chain\, a territory w
 hich falls mostly within the protected area of ​​the **Stelvio Nationa
 l Park**... AND MORE!\n\n• ITINERARY\nVISIT [https://www.campobase.trave
 l/en/experiences/travel/hiking-in-the-alps-of-trentino/](https://www.campo
 base.travel/en/experiences/travel/hiking-in-the-alps-of-trentino/)\n\n⭐
 ️ ⭐️ HOW TO REGISTER ⭐️ ⭐️\n[>> Please\, Click HERE <<](http
 s://www.campobase.travel/en/experiences/travel/hiking-in-the-alps-of-trent
 ino/)[ ](https://wildontours.com/products/italy-july-23)to see the full de
 scription and register via **Campo Base.**\n\n⭐️ Event offered in conj
 unction with Campo Base -- an Italian company specializing in adventure tr
 ips (CampoBase.travel) ⭐️
